# DIGITAL ECOSYSTEM OF THE CITY AS A DRIVER FOR SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT

**Authors:** A.G. Golova, E.V. Kurbatova

## Abstract
<jats:p>The article considers the experience of digital transformation of the urban services sector in conditions of economic stagnation using the example of digital services of the Moscow Government. The specificity of the considered digital services, their interconnections and interdependencies  from the point of view of the principles of the ecosystem is investigated. The penetration of  digital services among citizens and the level of satisfaction of the population with the proposed  solutions are analyzed. A human-centered approach to digitalization is considered and the main  barriers to further development are identified.</jats:p>

